# Docker
Dockerfile
.dockerignore

# Never send credentials to the Docker daemon or persist them in build layers.
# Public NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are passed as explicit build arguments instead.
# The `**/` prefix matters: a bare `.env*` only matches the repo root, while
# the real secrets live in nested files like apps/web/.env.local.
**/.env*
!.env.example
env.yaml

